Seam: BrowserView::InitViews (twice), ShouldDrawTabStrip, NonClientHitTest
      (both its paths).
Why: create the sidebar controller; move the location bar and the pinned
     extension buttons into the sidebar after the toolbar exists; hide the tab
     strip; drag the window by the sidebar and by a band along the top of the
     page. Both paths of the hit test are hooked: the one for immersive full
     screen and the one every ordinary window takes, which is the one that
     decides whether a window can be moved at all.
Delegates to: arcium/ui/browser/browser_sidebar_controller.cc

